;; This repository's own entry in the loop-*/skill-*/action- taxonomy it
;; originated (docs/adr/0001-loop-repository-taxonomy.md).
;;
;; The taxonomy ITSELF no longer lives here. It was a workspace-wide rule
;; stored inside one leaf repo — other repos (loop-innen, loop-lei-catalog,
;; catalog-maturity) cited this file as their contract source, and nothing
;; checked conformance. The rules now live in the superproject at
;; com-junkawasaki/root manifest/repository-rules.edn and are enforced by
;; scripts/verify-repository-roles.cljs. See ADR-2607299000.
;;
;; What stays here is this repo's own declaration, so a reader of THIS repo
;; alone can still see which contract it claims to satisfy — the same reason
;; loop-system-dynamics repeats its declaration rather than inheriting it.
{:schema "kotoba.repository-role-rules.v0"
 :this-repo
 {:prefix "loop-"
  :role :continuous-orchestrator
  :must [:observe :evaluate :decide :act :record-evidence]
  :must-not [:own-domain-scoring-truth :bind-to-one-ci-provider]
  :composition {:authority "loop-ux-kaizen"
                :adapters ["action-ux-kaizen" "skill-ux-kaizen"]
                :libraries ["design-quality" "hinshitsu" "browser-agent" "browser-use"]}}}
